                            {
                                "example_id": "beca8823-96b8-4f7a-8300-df2eb9a8b415",
                                "sense_id": "5d937ff9-9cd3-343f-871f-69ef7ddf05d9",
                                "text": "As we swung around, the full force of the current caught us and drove the stern against the rocks; there was a thud which sent a tremor through the whole craft, and then a moment of nasty grinding as the steel hull scraped the rock wall. I expected momentarily the inrush of waters that would seal our doom; but presently from below came the welcome word that all was well."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7aec8d43-6008-4a76-a203-0604539b5b34",
                                "sense_id": "5d937ff9-9cd3-343f-871f-69ef7ddf05d9",
                                "text": "We found Pop Glossop in his pantry polishing silver, and put in our order. He seemed a little surprised at the inrush of such a multitude, but on learning that our tongues were hanging out obliged with a bottle of the best […]"
